<mn>2</mn></msup><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><munder><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OP\">lim</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>θ</mi><mo accent=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">→</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>−</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"INNER\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">(</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>16</mn><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><menclose notation=\"updiagonalstrike\"><mn>3</mn></menclose></mrow></msup><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><menclose notation=\"updiagonalstrike\"><mi>cos</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></menclose></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>24</mn><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><menclose notation=\"updiagonalstrike\"><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></menclose></mrow><msup><mi>cos</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><menclose notation=\"updiagonalstrike\"><mn>2</mn></menclose></mrow></msup><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><munder><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OP\">lim</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>θ</mi><mo accent=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">→</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>−</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"INNER\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">(</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>16</mn><mi>sin</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>24</mn><mi>cos</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>16</mn><mi>sin</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>24</mn><mi>cos</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>0</mn><mn>24</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</li>\n<li><p>Statement III is false. Since the right limit of our derivative is not infinite, the curve does <em>not</em> have a vertical tangent at <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"172\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D703 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> In fact, it is a horizontal tangent.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div id=\"graphic-q-145211-e-0\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-145211-e-0\"></div>\n\n<p>Therefore, the correct answer is \"I only.\"</p>\n</div></div>",
